{"logId": "c0fed3ca-8097-4b8d-bc4a-a8b6a0d059c7", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "用我们的爱心净化一片天", "block_bbox": [239, 227, 820, 284], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 227.0], [820.0, 227.0], [820.0, 284.0], [239.0, 284.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：超市部/纽倩楠", "block_bbox": [258, 293, 417, 315], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[258.0, 293.0], [416.0, 293.0], [416.0, 314.0], [258.0, 314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "因工作的地方离家较远，再加上这几天天气寒冷，已经有好些天没回家了，归心似箭的我急急忙忙换了把零钱，登上了回家的公交车。", "block_bbox": [239, 372, 1015, 433], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 433.0], [239.0, 433.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [73, 602, 225, 727], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[73.0, 602.0], [225.0, 602.0], [225.0, 727.0], [73.0, 727.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "公交车上的乘客不算太多，我拣了个靠窗子的座位坐下。“市交警支队到了，请下车的乘客携带好随身物品下车……”，车子缓缓地停下。车门打开了，前门上来一位老大爷，想对司机说些什么，却又欲言又止。司机说：“怎么不投币？如果没有，就下车，别耽误大家的事！”“师傅，让我搭一下车吧，我车丢了，回不了家。”老大爷恳求道。看着老大爷可怜巴巴的样子，几位乘客也帮腔道：“师傅，让他搭一回吧，出门在外谁没有个难处啊！”司机很不乐意，但也没有赶他下去，然而却说了一句：“记着下回搭飞机。”一句羞辱的话，让老大爷羞红了耳根，愣在了那里。大家都很气愤，但都敢怒不敢言，我站起来把老大爷扶到座位上，又向投币箱里投了一元钱。“这一元钱我帮大爷掏！师傅，出门在外谁没个难处呀，谁没个父母，他这么大岁数了，你\n这样说，话有点重了。”经过询问，我了解到老大爷是尚集的，骑车进城买药，出来车子就不见了，身上的钱都买了药，所以没钱付车费。我告诉他以后买药，就到胖东来生活广场，不仅有看车的，而且有什么困难还可以找工作人员，他们一定会帮你的。老大爷感激地点点头：“闺女，谢谢你，早就听邻居说胖东来不仅东西好，便宜，人更是好得没话说，我今天算是知道了。”我低头一瞧，原来自己走得太急，工作证还戴着呢。这时乘客投来赞许的眼光，大家纷纷议论起胖东来。临下车，我又塞给了老人10元钱，因为我知道老大爷中途还需要换车。\n想着自己自从到胖东来变了许多，我学会了帮助别人，尊敬理解朋友，懂得报答父母的养育之恩。大家都说我变了。我知道：是胖东来改变了做一个真诚、热情、善良，富有爱心的人。", "block_bbox": [238, 442, 1017, 713], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 442.0], [1017.0, 442.0], [1017.0, 713.0], [238.0, 713.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [450, 720, 1017, 956], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[450.0, 720.0], [1017.0, 720.0], [1017.0, 956.0], [450.0, 956.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [544, 965, 1018, 1096], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[544.0, 965.0], [1018.0, 965.0], [1018.0, 1096.0], [544.0, 1096.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [565, 1104, 1016, 1233], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[565.0, 1104.0], [1016.0, 1104.0], [1016.0, 1233.0], [565.0, 1233.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [231, 723, 551, 1193], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 723.0], [551.0, 723.0], [551.0, 1193.0], [231.0, 1193.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我，是胖东来的理念让我学会了做人，做一个真诚、热情、善良，富有爱心的人。", "block_bbox": [237, 1208, 931, 1236], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 1208.0], [931.0, 1208.0], [931.0, 1236.0], [237.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一路走好", "block_bbox": [110, 1407, 263, 1448], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1407.0], [263.0, 1407.0], [263.0, 1448.0], [110.0, 1448.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8866596221923828, "coordinate": [239, 227, 820, 284], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 227.0], [820.0, 227.0], [820.0, 284.0], [239.0, 284.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7390577793121338, "coordinate": [258, 293, 417, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[258.0, 293.0], [416.0, 293.0], [416.0, 314.0], [258.0, 314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9007811546325684, "coordinate": [239, 372, 1015, 433], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 372.0], [1015.0, 433.0], [239.0, 433.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5497291088104248, "coordinate": [73, 602, 225, 727], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[73.0, 602.0], [225.0, 602.0], [225.0, 727.0], [73.0, 727.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9593765139579773, "coordinate": [238, 442, 1017, 713], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 442.0], [1017.0, 442.0], [1017.0, 713.0], [238.0, 713.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.7975707054138184, "coordinate": [231, 723, 551, 1193], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[231.0, 723.0], [551.0, 723.0], [551.0, 1193.0], [231.0, 1193.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4933074414730072, "coordinate": [450, 720, 1017, 956], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[450.0, 720.0], [1017.0, 720.0], [1017.0, 956.0], [450.0, 956.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5049965977668762, "coordinate": [544, 965, 1018, 1096], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[544.0, 965.0], [1018.0, 965.0], [1018.0, 1096.0], [544.0, 1096.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5285723805427551, "coordinate": [565, 1104, 1016, 1233], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[565.0, 1104.0], [1016.0, 1104.0], [1016.0, 1233.0], [565.0, 1233.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.38048750162124634, "coordinate": [237, 1208, 931, 1236], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 1208.0], [931.0, 1208.0], [931.0, 1236.0], [237.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.46663200855255127, "coordinate": [110, 1407, 263, 1448], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 1407.0], [263.0, 1407.0], [263.0, 1448.0], [110.0, 1448.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 用我们的爱心净化一片天\n\n作者：超市部/纽倩楠\n\n因工作的地方离家较远，再加上这几天天气寒冷，已经有好些天没回家了，归心似箭的我急急忙忙换了把零钱，登上了回家的公交车。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_602_225_727.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n公交车上的乘客不算太多，我拣了个靠窗子的座位坐下。“市交警支队到了，请下车的乘客携带好随身物品下车……”，车子缓缓地停下。车门打开了，前门上来一位老大爷，想对司机说些什么，却又欲言又止。司机说：“怎么不投币？如果没有，就下车，别耽误大家的事！”“师傅，让我搭一下车吧，我车丢了，回不了家。”老大爷恳求道。看着老大爷可怜巴巴的样子，几位乘客也帮腔道：“师傅，让他搭一回吧，出门在外谁没有个难处啊！”司机很不乐意，但也没有赶他下去，然而却说了一句：“记着下回搭飞机。”一句羞辱的话，让老大爷羞红了耳根，愣在了那里。大家都很气愤，但都敢怒不敢言，我站起来把老大爷扶到座位上，又向投币箱里投了一元钱。“这一元钱我帮大爷掏！师傅，出门在外谁没个难处呀，谁没个父母，他这么大岁数了，你\n\n这样说，话有点重了。”经过询问，我了解到老大爷是尚集的，骑车进城买药，出来车子就不见了，身上的钱都买了药，所以没钱付车费。我告诉他以后买药，就到胖东来生活广场，不仅有看车的，而且有什么困难还可以找工作人员，他们一定会帮你的。老大爷感激地点点头：“闺女，谢谢你，早就听邻居说胖东来不仅东西好，便宜，人更是好得没话说，我今天算是知道了。”我低头一瞧，原来自己走得太急，工作证还戴着呢。这时乘客投来赞许的眼光，大家纷纷议论起胖东来。临下车，我又塞给了老人10元钱，因为我知道老大爷中途还需要换车。\n\n想着自己自从到胖东来变了许多，我学会了帮助别人，尊敬理解朋友，懂得报答父母的养育之恩。大家都说我变了。我知道：是胖东来改变了做一个真诚、热情、善良，富有爱心的人。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_231_723_551_1193.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"26%\" /></div>\n\n\n我，是胖东来的理念让我学会了做人，做一个真诚、热情、善良，富有爱心的人。\n\n## 一 路走好", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_602_225_727.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0fed3ca-8097-4b8d-bc4a-a8b6a0d059c7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_73_602_225_727.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2F2a9a24241ec8536207f53fba879a58aa559a1c6419f45a7874e354ad68bf2796", "imgs/img_in_image_box_231_723_551_1193.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0fed3ca-8097-4b8d-bc4a-a8b6a0d059c7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_231_723_551_1193.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc54b4a5c6a294606283b3a0195b3bc1e713313f367a747d6635f10fdb643058d"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0fed3ca-8097-4b8d-bc4a-a8b6a0d059c7/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff35040afa7525cd379314ac86a3d251eec422850446aa6297c87c3b19cd0833a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0fed3ca-8097-4b8d-bc4a-a8b6a0d059c7/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb76b101d79cfa5c8138e5eb114a1c3577333404a8c9ef4e972dab5fa97da1b05"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c0fed3ca-8097-4b8d-bc4a-a8b6a0d059c7/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A01Z%2F-1%2F%2Fabcf694eca6f88299e62f5edf98c6e81b34519beae60a72f3db74baf1fdc14de"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
